  "description": "The embedding functions of Chroma for .NET, computed locally. The default one: all-MiniLM-L6-v2 in ONNX, with the same vectors as the Python client. The hosted ones of Chroma Cloud: chroma-cloud-qwen (Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B) and chroma-cloud-splade (SPLADE), without an account or an API key. IEmbeddingGenerator of Microsoft.Extensions.AI, for ChromaDotNet.Client 2.17.0 and later. The models are downloaded at the first start and checked with their SHA-256: the default one into the cache folder of Python, the hosted ones from Hugging Face. On .NET 8 and later the default model runs through ElBruno.LocalEmbeddings by Bruno Capuano; on .NET Framework (Windows, 64-bit), and for the hosted models, on ONNX Runtime. Tokenizer: Hugging Face, through Tokenizers.DotNet. Intel Macs and 32-bit processes are not supported. Independent project. Not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Chroma Inc. CHROMA is a registered trademark of Chroma Inc., used here only to describe compatibility.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
