  "published": "2026-10-28T13:30:27.707Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.5: the hosted embedding functions of Chroma Cloud, computed on this machine, with the vectors of the service within small differences. ChromaQwenEmbeddingGenerator is chroma-cloud-qwen: Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B in ONNX, float16 by default or float32, 1024 dimensions, with the instructions of the task nl_to_code for the queries. ChromaSpladeEmbeddingGenerator is chroma-cloud-splade: the sparse embeddings of SPLADE, prithivida/Splade_PP_en_v1. Their models are downloaded from Hugging Face at the first start, at fixed revisions, and checked with their SHA-256. The default model does not change. On .NET 8 and later it runs through ElBruno.LocalEmbeddings 1.6.6, not 1.6.4. That version changes only its model downloader, which this package does not use. All the releases: https://github.com/ChromaDotNet/ChromaDB.Embeddings/releases.",
